{"title":"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 15","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sale ad read: \"Buy three tires at the regular price and get the fourth tire for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/8/6b8330695531f86e8c16eacddb8938b44bf81015.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$3.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"16\" />\" Sam paid <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/0/80068c4dae952a8c90d115feeab0462780b8818c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$240$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"38\" height=\"16\" /> for a set of four tires at the sale.  What was the regular price of one tire?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/5/f25b96d310de0063b39049871f182a488d7ce2dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ \\$59.25 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ \\$60 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ \\$70 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ \\$79 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ \\$80$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"447\" height=\"19\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> be the regular price of a tire.  Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/4/ee47868f8e723bd157c9f1a452115cbf3eb48812.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x + \\$3 = \\$240$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"122\" height=\"17\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/7/d778ffd186ddb168a7942f780f321db53998dab2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\$79}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"110\" height=\"31\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since Sam paid <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/0/80068c4dae952a8c90d115feeab0462780b8818c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$240$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"38\" height=\"16\" /> for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> tires, which included <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/1/831d26f39684cd7cfa4ae5f2a0098b432dc8a6ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> for the last one, he paid <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/1/0c16d49c07d034a85482bee2d242f54fae31a8ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$240 - \\$3 = \\$237$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"139\" height=\"17\" /> for the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> tires at regular price.  Therefore, the regular price of a tire is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/2/ca251b39d5f6adc06fcece02c6b74750004fa3a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$237 \\div 3 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(D) } \\$79}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"168\" height=\"31\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME\" title=\"1987 AJHSME\">1987 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1987\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 16\">Problem 16</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_8_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 8 Problems and Solutions\"> All AJHSME/AMC 8 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Fil